Gating setMultiplier on
onlyMaster so that it inherits the master delay after handover also removes the manipulation, and is the single
change that closes both this and the regular-path finding.
Securitize: Fixed in commit 67bd52a by gating setMultiplier to onlyMaster instead of onlyIssuerOrAbove so
a compromised issuer can't change the rebasing multiplier.
