gradeable::owner upgrade authority over live ROLE_ISSUER and ROLE_TRANSFER_AGENT proxies and
can burn, seize holder balances with no delay
Description: ServiceConsumer::onlyMaster authorizes two independent principals: the contract's own Ownable-
Upgradeable::owner, or the address holding ROLE_MASTER in TrustService.
modifier onlyMaster {
if (owner() != msg.sender) require(getTrustService().getRole(msg.sender) == ROLE_MASTER,
""Insufficient trust level"");
