0x59c1eAcEc450c57Dcb9b8725d0F96635C2b676Ee. That WalletRegistrar proxy itself holds ROLE_ISSUER on the
live token. Running the documented handover against this deployment therefore takes the skip branch for one
entry, surrenders ROLE_MASTER, and only then fails verification.
