# 2, ROLE_ISSUER
cast call --block $BLOCK $TRUST ""getRole(address)(uint8)"" $WR_OWNER
# 0, no role
2. Run setup-governance --handover as the signer holding ROLE_MASTER; the loop reaches id 1024, finds an
owner that is not the signer, prints its skip line and continues
