Description: verify-governance establishes the compliance domain by reading the compliance service's own
COMPLIANCE_RULES_TIMELOCK slot and comparing it to the token's mirrored entry:
const ccsTimelock = await
complianceConfigurationService.getDSService(DSConstants.services.COMPLIANCE_RULES_TIMELOCK);
,!
