Description: The operation id is keccak256(abi.encode(_to, _amount, _salt, block.timestamp)), guarded
by require(pendingMints[operationId].readyAt == 0). Because the timestamp is part of the preimage, the
guard binds only within a single block. The same _to, _amount and _salt submitted in any later block yields a
different id and a second, independently executable pending mint.
