Description: TuoVaultStorage::_setHlOperator rejects only the zero address, allowing the treasury to register
the vault itself as a Hyperliquid operator. TuoVault::bridgeToHl then debits the position's idle USDC and records
outstanding margin, but its vault-to-vault transfer moves no tokens.
