TuoVaultViews::keeperBudgetOf returns a mixed action-and-loss snapshot during a keeper swap
callback
Description: TuoVault::swapIdle calls _consumeKeeperAction before routing the swap but does not call _-
chargeKeeperLoss until after the external aggregator returns. During the aggregator call, a callback can therefore
read TuoVaultViews::keeperBudgetOf while the vault's reentrancy guard is entered because this view does not
call _noReentrantRead.
