cannot withhold, cancel, re-time, or re-rate it. It vests linearly to delegators (via share price) over an explicit duration; overlapping
rounds rebase;
−Commission fixed up front. Any owner cut is skimmed atomically at the current rate when the reward is funded; the vesting portion
carries no commission, so nothing can be skimmed at a later, owner-chosen moment;
−Two-phase commission changes. Increases require proposeCommissionRate (owner) + approveCommissionRate (maintainer); de-
creases are immediate. An owner can no longer unilaterally spike the rate before a round;
