the view is read on an unsettled schedule, that is, an active entry that has ended but has not yet been promoted, or a queued entry whose
vesting window has already started, the figure it returns does not match what the schedule actually still owes. The ended active entry is
dropped to 0 while its funds still sit unmoved in lockedRewardPool, and the queued entry is counted at its full value even though part of it
would already have vested. In practice this over reports the outstanding amount rather than under reporting it.
