tlement can receive a value that does not reflect the entity’s true outstanding obligation and that changes the moment anyone calls
processRewards(...).
Recommendation(s): Consider revisiting the view so that the value it reports does not depend on whether the schedule has been settled
recently, or documenting that it is exact only immediately after settlement.
