6.19
[Info] The configured minimum stake amount is never enforced
File(s): contracts/vanaStaking/vanaPoolStaking/VanaPoolStakingImplementation.sol
Description: The VanaPoolStaking contract stores a minStakeAmount, exposes it through the staking interface, and lets a maintainer
change it through the updateMinStakeAmount(...) function, which emits an event announcing the new value. Every consumer of that
