(scheduledValue −vested(lastUpdate)) rather than the clock, so the view reports exactly the escrow still to leave lockedRewardPool
regardless of when it is read; the queued entry continues to count in full until promoted. Immediately after settlement the value equals the
previous one, so the internal escrow check is unchanged. Tests in CommittedRewardsView.t.sol, including a fuzz that committedRewards ≤
lockedRewardPool at every point, settled or not.
