2
receive() external payable {
3
// @audit no check for msg.value == 0
4
emit Funded(msg.sender, msg.value);
5
}
6
Recommendation(s): Consider emitting the event only if msg.value is > zero.
Status: Fixed
Update from the client: Fixed (2b5849b). receive() emits Funded only when msg.value > 0; a zero-value call is still accepted but emits
nothing. Test: test_zeroValueFundingEmitsNoEvent (RewardSplitter.t.sol).
