File(s): src/weiroll-helpers/UniswapV4SwapHelpers.sol, src/Router.sol
Description: The _pullInput(...) function measures the balance difference before and after a token transfer instead of relying on the
declared input amount. However, the _processPulledInputs(...) function doesn’t do the same.
1
function _processPulledInputs(...) internal returns (...)
2
{
3
//..
4
//@audit-issue inputAmounts is the gross amount before any FoT fees are applied
5
inputAmountSum += params.inputAmounts[i];
6
7
//@audit pulled already has some fees subtracted due to the transfer
8
//that occured inside _pullInput
9
uint256 pulled = pulledArr[i];
10
//..
11
12
totalProtocolFees += protocolFee;
13
totalInputPartnerFees += inputPartnerFee;
14
uint256 forward = pulled - protocolFee - inputPartnerFee;
15
16
