Uniswap’s Universal Router address differs per chain, and some chains hold two versions of the Universal Router contract. You can find
a list with the deployed instances here. The ""legacy"" version has an ExactInputSingleParams struct with only 5 fields instead of 6 and on
some chains, both UR versions are deployed.
