The _nextMessageId(...) function computes the messageId as the hash of the depositor, the chain ID, the vault’s nonce, the net amount,
the destination and the recipient. The nonce is incremented on every deposit, so two deposits into the same vault always receive different
IDs, even when all their other parameters are identical.
