CB-138,FR-344,The creator's seed position has no lockup and the curve funds its exit,QuillAudits__Cracker_Smart_Contract_Audit_Report_-_QuillAudits.pdf,QuillAudits,cracker,2026-08-31,no,no,2026-09,High,"High Severity Issues
High Severity Issues
The creator's seed position has no lockup and the curve
funds its exit
Acknowledged
Path
contracts/BondingCurve.sol, contracts/TokenFactory.sol
Function Name
seedBuy(), _buy(), sell(), TokenFactory.createLaunch()
Three properties combine on the ordinary trading path, with no privileged position required.
The seed position is exclusive, not merely early. seedBuy is factory-only and reverts WrongPhase
on any curve where tokensSold != 0 (BondingCurve.sol:271), so it executes inside createLaunch, in
the same transaction, against a virgin curve. No other party is capable of transacting at that point
in the curve's life; it cannot be front-run, outbid, or bought alongside.
There is no lockup. _buy transfers to beneficiary at BondingCurve.sol:318 and the tokens are
immediately transferable. No vesting, cliff, or cooldown exists anywhere on the creator path. The
seed position is sellable in the very next block. This is the load-bearing ingredient.
The exit is unbounded. maxBuyWei and maxCreatorBuyWei are tested only inside _buy. sell (:338-
370) has no cap parameter, no per-transaction bound, and no cooldown. Entry is braked; exit is
not. A sell cap would not fix this the creator can split a dump across blocks exactly as buyers split
buys so the lockup, not the cap, is the fix target.
Impact
Buyers who enter the curve after createLaunch lose up to 75% of their deposited ETH to a creator
exiting an uncontested floor position with no holding period. Because createLaunch is
permissionless, an attacker mints their own launch this requires no privileged position, no
settlement failure, and no RECOVERY. Creation is free, so the pattern scripts to N launches: seed
each at the floor, dump whichever catch volume, abandon the rest for gas.
Likelihood
Medium-to-High. No trust barrier, no capital beyond the seed, fully automatable, and profitable at
every level of inflow. The only timing constraint is that the creator must sell before any buy
triggers CLOSED, since sells revert after graduation.
