www.quillaudits.com

Lendary - Audit Report
High Severity Issues
High Severity Issues
H-02
Premium auto-compound positions can be permanently
frozen after partialUnstake
Resolved
Path
Staking.sol
Function Name
_accrueStakeFor()
Description
_accrueStakeFor books rewards linearly and moves lastAccrualTimestamp without moving
lastMonthlySettledAt , and the auto-compound loop is skipped while a partialUnstake slice is in
cooldown. If that slice is withdrawn after the next month boundary, lastAccrualTimestamp lands past
that boundary and every later accrual underflows on:
uint256 dtStep = nextMonthEnd - uint256(pos.lastAccrualTimestamp);
A partialUnstake made more than (MONTH - tier cooldown) after the last month boundary always
triggers this, since the cooldown itself ends past the next boundary.
Impact
High
unstake , unstakeEarly , partialUnstake and claimMonthlyRewards revert forever for the position,
locking its remaining principal and rewards, and pendingRewards() reverts for the whole userId .
Likelihood
Medium
Recommendation
Never let dtStep underflow and never move lastAccrualTimestamp backwards, in both
_accrueStakeFor and _simulateAutoCompoundForPosition .
