Lendary - Audit Report
Low Severity Issues
L-01
Anyone can revert batchClaimFor by front-running it with
claimTokens for one entry 
As a result, batch claiming is unreliable and anyone can grief it repeatedly for the cost of a single claim,
which delays vesting payouts for every other beneficiary in the batch.
Impact
Low
No tokens are lost or redirected, because every claim still pays the rightful beneficiary. The keeper loses
the gas of each reverted batch, and up to 24 other beneficiaries have their payout delayed every time
the attack is repeated. The attacker makes no profit and pays the gas for each front-running claim.
Likelihood
Medium
Recommendation
Make batchClaimFor skip entries that have nothing to claim instead of reverting, so one already-
claimed entry cannot cancel the rest of the batch.
