Rewards) and 90,000,000 LRY for category 3 (Liquidity). The vesting percentages for both categories
add up to 100% of the registered amount, so the vesting schedule never releases the remaining
25,000,000 and 10,000,000 LRY.
Each shortfall is exactly 10% of its documented allocation. That matches the 10% immediate release
Vesting applies to private sale purchases, which suggests a TGE unlock handled outside the contract.
Nothing in the code or comments says so, and no on-chain logic accounts for the missing 35,000,000
LRY.
