Informational Severity Issues
Informational Severity Issues
I-03
Misspelled function name vestingCalulations in Vesting
Resolved
Path
contracts/Vesting.sol
Function Name
vestingCalulations()
Description
Vesting declares a function named vestingCalulations . It sums the release percentages between a
user's last claim period and the current one, and tokensToBeClaimed calls it to work out the claimable
amount. The name is misspelled and should be vestingCalculations . The function works correctly, but
the misspelling makes the code harder to read and search.
Impact
Low
There is no effect on funds or behaviour. It only affects readability and maintainability.
Likelihood
Low
Recommendation
Rename the function to vestingCalculations and update every call site.
