Function Name
setBaseDescription(), tokenURI()
Description
All LP NFT metadata is derived from one owner-controlled _baseDescription.
Impact
Older LP NFTs can have their displayed metadata changed after mint, weakening metadata integrity for
users and indexers.
Recommendation
Remove metadata mutation or add a one-way freeze mechanism and document when metadata
becomes final.
