Medium Severity Issues
Unbounded tMUSD minting is controlled by a single
externally owned account
Acknowledged
Path
TestToken.sol
Function Name
constructor(), mint(), owner(), blacklister()
Description
tMUSD has uncapped owner minting. The deployed owner is an EOA and also controls the blacklist,
factory, LP storage, and descriptor admin roles.
Impact
A compromised or misused key can mint arbitrary tMUSD, swap it through live pools, and extract paired
