RapidDex - Audit Report
Medium Severity Issues
Medium Severity Issues
Paused tMUSD can be made permanently unresumable
through ownership renunciation
Resolved
Path
TestToken.sol, Ownable.sol
Function Name
pause(), unpause(), renounceOwnership()
Description
pause() and unpause() are owner-only, but inherited renounceOwnership() can remove the owner forever.
Impact
If tMUSD is paused before ownership is renounced or the owner key is lost, transfers, mints, burns,
swaps, and LP exits can remain frozen permanently.
Recommendation
Disable renounceOwnership() or replace the single owner with recoverable multisig or governance-
controlled roles.
