Medium Severity Issues
Non-zero allowance resets expose users to old-plus-new
allowance spending
Resolved
Path
WMST.sol, TestToken.sol
Function Name
approve(), transferFrom()
Description
Both tokens allow a non-zero allowance to be overwritten with another non-zero allowance.
Impact
With a sandwich operation, an approved spender can spend the old allowance before the reset lands,
then spend the new allowance after it lands.
Recommendation
Require non-zero allowance changes to pass through zero, or expose safer increase and decrease
allowance flows with SafeERC20.
