Tradevu - Audit Report
Low Severity Issues
Low Severity Issues
L-09
Unclaimed redemptions are swept to adminWallet
with no grace period
Acknowledged
Path
TradevuEscrow
Function Name
claimWindow
Description
The claim window opens when the issuer funds redemption and lasts claimWindow seconds. Once it
ends, redeemBillTokens reverts with ClaimTimeEnded, and the issuer can sweep everything left in the
pool to adminWallet. There is no grace period, no extension and no later claim path.
A holder who does not redeem in time loses the entire payout, and it becomes protocol revenue instead
of remaining claimable. Holders who acquired tokens by transfer may not know when funding happened,
and Token.initialize only requires claimWindow > 0, so a window can be as short as one second.
Impact
Medium
Medium for the affected holders: their entire redemption value moves to adminWallet.
Likelihood
Low
Low. A holder has to miss the window; this becomes more likely with short windows or with holders who
received tokens by transfer.
Recommendation
Guarantee holders a reasonable minimum claim period and some way to claim after it closes, for
example by keeping unclaimed balances in a reserve holders can still draw from, rather than converting
them into protocol revenue.
Tradevu Team's Comment
Acknowledged. User has to redeem till claim window time.
