TradevuEscrow
Description
The README says that on redemption ""their whole balance is burned"". When the pool cannot cover a
holder's full payout, the code burns only the portion that was paid and leaves the rest in the holder's
wallet (see issue 6). Those leftover tokens cannot be redeemed for anything, because the pool is empty.
Recommendation
Align the documentation with the partial-burn behaviour, or change the behaviour to match the
documentation.
