3. On the current older Ethereum messenger, Circle accepts the source burn. The vault is emptied,
Ethereum USDC is burned, and Zynk increases principalIn by 1,000 USDC ([accounting update]
(src/facets/TransactionsFacet.sol#L298)).
4. Assume Circle attests the Fast transfer with fee_executed = 0.1 USDC ( 100,000 USDC base units).
The delivered message contains max_fee = 0 and fee_executed = 100,000 .
