(https://github.com/circlefin/solana-cctp-
contracts/blob/b37d577fc1dc317ce9bc0316c5063afe38744ce3/programs/v2/token-messenger-minter-
v2/src/token_messenger_v2/instructions/handle_receive_finalized_message.rs#L178). The recipient
transfer happens only after that check ([transfer path](https://github.com/circlefin/solana-cctp-
contracts/blob/b37d577fc1dc317ce9bc0316c5063afe38744ce3/programs/v2/token-messenger-minter-
v2/src/token_messenger_v2/instructions/handle_receive_finalized_message.rs#L188-L209)), so it
transfers nothing to Zynk's configured Solana recipient. The finalized Ethereum burn cannot be undone
by that later Solana transaction failure.
