wallet can revoke the wallet update request by calling rejectWalletUpdate(). As a result wallets can never
be updated.
Impact
Wallets can never be updated.
Recommendation
Make it only admin controlled function.
Zynk EVM Team's Comment
This is a non-negotiable requirement imposed by the LPs: the authority to reject a wallet update
request must not rest solely with the admin.
For such cases, we can explore alternative measures, including more definitive administrative
actions, where necessary.
Ignore the previous comment.
We are going with the recommended fix:
