df395593c71ee01881b16e/contracts/MapleWithdrawalManager.sol#L205-L232
Tool Used
Manual Review
Recommendation
Consider processing the strategy manager redemption and the withdrawal queue in one
transaction whenever liquidity is sourced from an impaired strategy.
As discussed with the team, the operational admin will be able to process the
redemption from an impaired strategy. It already passes the withdrawal manager's onlyR
9

edeemer, so it can batch processRedemption() and processRedemptions() in one
transaction. The LP is then paid at the impaired price in the same transaction that burns
the strategy manager shares, and there is no point at which the cash is sourced and the
