processRedemptions() skips a cancelled request without reverting, so a cancel that lands
just before the batch still leaves the strategy manager redemption executed. To rule
that out, the operational admin can clear the requester's permission in MaplePoolPermiss
ionManager before sending the batch and restore it after. removeSharesById() returns
