059432cd6c36e3e
0xsimao
Fix in #a3f77cc looks good, the guard is no longer needed for queue managers, and the
to be upgraded pools SyrupUSDC, SyrupUSDT, SyrupUSDG and MISL don't use the
cyclical manager.
