1. DelphoHyperCoreConfig initializer: delete the _systemAddresses[USDC] assignment
and its SystemAddressUpdated event. Keep the USDT entry.
2. BaseConfigProviderUpgrade._syncStablecoinConfig: it is invoked for StableCoinTy
pe.USDC and calls setSystemAddress(oldToken, oldSystemAddress), so it will copy
16

the live value onto the new provider. Skip the system-address half for USDC and
sync only stablecoinToken. Its existing early return on oldSystemAddress == address
(0) already cooperates once the value is zero upstream.
3. script/prod/nonStable/02_DeploymentScript: remove the setSystemAddress(USDC,
USDC_SYSTEM_ADDRESS) call.
4. script/prod/stable/02_DeploymentScript: remove the equivalent call.
