Supported collateral tokens are
,→
*
resolved via configured `stablecoinToken` mappings (USDC, USDT).
Mint/redeem fees
,→
*
are sent immediately to `feeReceiver`. Executor returns are capped at
deployed principal (partial returns allowed).
,→
*
Liabilities are tracked per collateral; redeem is bound to that
collateral's liabilities and buffer.
,→
*/
/// @dev Returns true when `collateral` matches a non-zero configured
`stablecoinToken` for USDC.
,→
function _isSupportedCollateral(address collateral) internal view returns
(bool) {
,→
if (collateral == address(0)) return false;
IDelphoConfigProvider cfg = IDelphoConfigProvider(delphoConfigProvider);
address usdc = cfg.stablecoinToken(StableCoinType.USDC);
[...excerpt ends]"
