Tool Used
Manual Review
Recommendation
DelphoRouterV2 already holds the registry of every configured market in marketConfigs,
so it is the natural place to compare sibling health at redemption time. Track the
configured market keys and, on redemption, read each market's aggregate LTV and
either refuse or reprice a redemption against a market that is materially healthier than a
sibling which is above its target LTV.
Alternatively, an intersected sorted debts can be used but such a redemption and
liquidation would be much more complex due to dual design.
