0xfarhaan
We have added the operational admin to be able to process redemptions on the
strategy manager as fixed in this PR https://github.com/maple-labs/strategy-manager/
commit/dc8aac619aac99d5d52f6fc42421140851bef089
As per the recommendation this will be dealt with operationally. Initially non impaired
strategies will be used for liquidity to facilitate LP withdrawals. In the case the impaired
strategy is the last liquidity source with LPs willing to withdraw an atomic batch will be
created to set permissions and process withdrawals across the strategy and pool before
restoring permissions.
Additionally we have updated the WM removeSharesById() function to include the
standard pool permission manager check we have across LP facing functions which will
give Maple the ability to pause redemption cancellations to avoid front running.
