Recommendations
Do not persist a raw oracle answer across transactions based only on block.number. Read the
feed once per deposit, mint, withdraw, or redeem and pass one coherent (oracle, decimals,
answer) snapshot through that execution.
If caching is retained, bind it to the oracle address, decimal scale, freshness delay, and feed round
or update fingerprint. Refresh that tuple atomically on every oracle-policy change, and test
same-feed updates, delay tightening, and decimal rotations around a zero-amount cache prime.
