IUniswapV2Pair(target).swap(/* amountOut computed above */);
The same applies when the pair quotes through getAmountOut(amountIn, tokenIn), which is
also called with the nominal amount.
When tokenIn is a fee-on-transfer token, or a rebasing token that delivers 1 to 2 wei less (such as
stETH), the pair receives less than amountIn. The output was priced for the larger amount, so the
