frxUSD Ecosystem Smart Contract Security Assessment
October 19, 2026
transition before a history slot can be reused.
Define disabled-time semantics explicitly; zero-valued placeholder fields should not decide
whether prior usage refills. Test faster and slower replacements, zero-valued disabled overrides,
and the intended refill or reset policy.
Remediation
