onlyInitializing modifier:
function __init_HopV201(
uint32 _localEid,
address _endpoint,
uint32 _numDVNs,
address _EXECUTOR,
address _DVN,
address _TREASURY,
address[] memory _approvedOfts
) internal {
_grantRole(DEFAULT_ADMIN_ROLE, msg.sender);
HopV2Storage storage $ = _getHopV2Storage();
$.localEid = _localEid;
$.endpoint = _endpoint;
// Additional configuration writes.
}
The reviewed call surface is safe as of the time of writing. The only production caller of this
HopV201Tempo helper is RemoteHopV201Tempo.initialize(), which is marked initializer. The
helper is internal and absent from the external ABI, and the implementation constructors call
_disableInitializers(). The active protection comes from the current caller and inheritance
graph, not from the helper itself.
Impact
A future derived contract could invoke the helper outside initialization, for example from a setter or
migration entry point. That path would grant DEFAULT_ADMIN_ROLE to its caller, overwrite the hop's
scalar routing and fee-infrastructure configuration, and add the supplied OFT approvals.
