Reviewed implementations are upgrade-only targets
Reference ID: ZELLIC-D53ZSV
The reviewed frax-tokens FrxUSD and SfrxUSD implementations were evaluated for upgrade
safety. Storage-layout comparisons and forked upgrade tests confirmed that they are valid
upgrade targets for initialized legacy proxies.
The narrower constraint is that they are not fresh-proxy templates. The implementation instances
are locked, while new empty proxies cannot reconstruct the legacy owner, timelock, token, and
accounting state through a current initializer.
Document this upgrade-only assumption and require storage-layout and forked
state-preservation tests for each upgrade. Fresh deployments need a separately reviewed
